                "text": "Two potentially huge blows to the radical gender ideology agenda:\n\n1. Immediately put my bill H.R. 3887 on floor for a vote. It passed out of committee months ago. Defunding children\u2019s hospitals that transition minors should have happened by now.\n\n2. On day one, Trump\u2019s DOJ can reverse the charges against Dr. Haim, a Texas doctor being persecuted by the Biden DOJ for exposing children\u2019s hospitals doing harmful gender procedures.\n\nhttps://t.co/rvEmhfHJ3R",
