                "text": "This means making President Trump\u2019s price transparency rules for hospitals and insurers law, so that Americans know what they are paying for health care services. Right now, we have little to no knowledge of negotiated prices, making it very difficult to have free market forces. Transparency will create market competition and lower prices.",
