                "text": "The devastation from the California fires is even worse because many homes are uninsured. Why? California\u2019s regulations made it financially unsustainable for insurers to offer wildfire coverage. It\u2019s sad to be making these critiques while families have lost everything, but it has to be said. The California political model is an abject failure. The progressive experiment has proven- over and over- that good feelings don\u2019t make good results.  Informative thread from @mfcannon \ud83e\uddf5",
