                "text": "I\u2019m co-leading the Protect Medicaid Act with @RepRichHudson to stop federal tax dollars from being funneled into Medicaid coverage for illegal immigrants.\n\nMedicaid is meant for American citizens who need it most\u2014seniors, children, pregnant women, and the disabled. But liberal states are finding ways to game the system and make taxpayers cover healthcare for illegal immigrants.\n\nThat\u2019s not just wrong, it\u2019s illegal. And we\u2019re going to put a stop to it.",
