                "text": "The @EnergyCommerce Democrats want to paint us as heartless villains out to strip healthcare from children and people with disabilities. That\u2019s simply not true. You know what\u2019s actually cruel? Telling vulnerable families their coverage is in danger when it\u2019s not\u2014scaring them into panic, and convincing them to fly to D.C. based on lies. That\u2019s political theater at its worst.\n\n@HouseCommerce",
