                "text": "Yeah okay Senator here\u2019s the thing: YOU JUST VOTED AGAINST A CLEAN FUNDING BILL THAT KEEPS FUNDING ALIVE FOR SAFETY NET HOSPITALS, among many many other things.\n\nSit down and shut up. We aren\u2019t letting you people spin this.",
