                "text": "Democrats are driving massive airport delays, creating millions of backlogged Social Security and VA claims, and holding military and federal workers\u2019 paychecks hostage.\n\nTheir reason? They want you to keep subsidizing Obamacare premiums with your tax dollars.\n\nThe only winners here are bureaucrats and big insurance companies\u2014not hardworking Americans.\n\nDr. Ge Bai breaks down three key reasons why Obamacare has been a disaster for healthcare markets\u2014and for anyone who wants affordable, accessible insurance that fits their needs.\n\nFind the rest of our conversation on my Hold These Truths podcast.",
